# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for the by-product-exchange R project
#
# Anything listed here will NOT be uploaded to GitHub. Comments (lines
# starting with #) are for humans only; Git ignores them.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Raw survey data (confidential) ----------------------------------
*.xlsx
*.xls
inputs/waste_tidy.RData

# ---- IMPORTANT EXCEPTIONS -------------------------------------------
# codebook.xlsx holds the sector, owner-role and volume-band lookup
# tables. Script 02 cannot run without it and it contains no personal
# data, so it must NOT be ignored. The "!" means "keep this one".
!inputs/codebook.xlsx

# The de-identified file that IS published.
!inputs/waste_tidy.RData

# ---- R and RStudio working files -------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# ---- System files ----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db